; Additional macOS sandbox rules, appended to the built-in policy.
; Use SBPL rule fragments; do not add (version 1) or a default policy.
; Use absolute paths. Changes apply to new codex exec/app-server and dsh processes.
; The system account's .codex-proxy directory remains protected; only env is readable.
;
; Example: deny access to another sensitive directory.
; (deny file-read* file-write* (subpath "/absolute/path/to/private"))
